        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MDHM, Floor Mounted Magnetic Door Stop and Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Modern Magnetic Door Holder is installed by floor mounting the catch and mounting the magnet base onto your door. When the door is opened, the magnet catches on to the stainless steel holder, thus securing the door. The floor mounted body is made high-impact black nylon with the inner stainless steel pop-out catch. The Floor Mounted Magnetic Door Stop is available in 2 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MDHM-installed.jpg?v=1704354578\" width=\"437\" height=\"266\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana MDHM Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MDHM Modern Magnetic Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Catch Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Mount Center to Center: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Mount Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MDHM-specifications.pdf?v=1704262416\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MDHM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
